{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time ramping with optical flow time ramping with optical flow","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","fileName":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matte Painting and Scene Finishing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time ramping with optical flow time ramping with optical flow","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","fileName":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow","heading":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Time remapping compresses or stretches sections of a clip between keyframes to make action speed up or slow down. Slow motion needs new intermediate frames; simple frame blending can ghost moving subjects. Optical flow estimates pixel motion to synthesize the in-between images, but crossing or overlapping limbs can confuse it and create smears. The book suggests isolating troublesome components with mattes, ramping them separately, and recombining them when a severe speed change breaks the automatic interpolation. Temporal repair is another form of constrained scene finishing.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"time ramping with optical flow time ramping with optical flow","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","fileName":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Time Ramping with Optical Flow","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}